    {
      "text": "A line chart titled \"EPI: Tracer vaccines administered - last 12 months\" for Trainingland, January to December 2016, with doses administered on the y-axis (0 to 40k). Six series are shown: BCG, DPT-HepB-HIB 1, DPT-HepB-HIB 3, MR 1, MR 2 and yellow fever doses given. All six lines are roughly flat across the year, between about 20k and 33k a month, with BCG highest and MR 2 lowest.",
